<title>SRI LANKA: Sri lanka's Horana nine-month net up.</title>
<headline>Sri lanka's Horana nine-month net up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Horana Plantations Ltd for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1996		     1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	    348.84	vs	  315.16</p>
<p>    Net profit	   38.11	vs	   26.75</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is one of six privatised estate firms trading in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
